  "question": {
    "text": "If the area bounded by <math><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>π</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>≤</mo><mi>π</mi></math> and <math><mi>y</mi><mo>≥</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>π</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>K</mi><msup><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;sq. units,&nbsp;then the value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>8</mn><mi>K</mi></math>&nbsp;is equal to",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "2",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/d6ecc98f-666f-4329-a106-b5c05f642e6f.png\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width:2.77361in;height:1.46667in\" /><br />Given curve is <math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Solving with <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo></math> we get,</p><p>&nbsp;<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math> as <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math> as <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Thus, the required area is <math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#8901;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8901;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#8901;</mo><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>&#8901;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>&nbsp;sq. units</p>",
